<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Chi tiết đơn hàng</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/client/css/style.css" />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@4.3.1/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"
      integrity="sha384-ggOyR0iXCbMQv3Xipma34MD+dH/1fQ784/j6cY/iJTQUOhcWr7x9JvoRxT2MZw1T"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
    />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/5.15.4/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
      :root {
        --primary: #111;
        --secondary: #f5f5f5;
        --accent: #28a745;
        --text: #111;
        --text-light: #666;
        --border: #e5e5e5;
        --shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        --shadow-hover: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
        --transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        --gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa 0%, #ffffff 100%);
        --gradient-dark: linear-gradient(45deg, #111 30%, #333 90%);
        --gradient-success: linear-gradient(45deg, #28a745 0%, #20c997 100%);
      }

      body {
        font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
        color: var(--text);
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .detail-container {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 80px auto;
        padding: 0 20px;
        position: relative;
      }

      .detail-container::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        height: 400px;
        background: var(--gradient);
        z-index: 0;
        transform: skewY(-3deg);
        transform-origin: top left;
      }

      .detail-card {
        background: white;
        border-radius: 24px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        animation: fadeInUp 1s ease;
      }

      .detail-header {
        background: var(--gradient-dark);
        color: white;
        padding: 40px;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .detail-header::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        height: 4px;
        background: var(--gradient-success);
      }

      .order-status {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 8px 16px;
        background: var(--gradient-success);
        color: white;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .order-id {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .order-date {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      }

      .detail-body {
        padding: 40px;
      }

      .info-section {
        margin-bottom: 40px;
      }

      .info-block {
        background: var(--gradient);
        border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
        padding: 25px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        animation: fadeInUp 1s ease 0.4s backwards;
      }

      .info-block p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .info-block strong {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--text);
        margin-right: 10px;
      }

      .section-title {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text);
        margin-bottom: 25px;
        position: relative;
        padding-bottom: 15px;
        animation: fadeInUp 1s ease 0.6s backwards;
      }

      .section-title::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 60px;
        height: 3px;
        background: var(--gradient-dark);
        border-radius: 2px;
      }

      .table {
        margin-top: 20px;
        border-collapse: separate;
        border-spacing: 0;
        width: 100%;
        animation: fadeInUp 1s ease 0.8s backwards;
      }

      .table thead th {
        background: var(--gradient-dark);
        color: white;
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        padding: 15px;
        border: none;
      }

      .table tbody tr {
        transition: var(--transition);
      }

      .table tbody tr:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .table tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
      }

      .table td {
        padding: 20px 15px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      .total-row {
        background: var(--gradient) !important;
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .delivery-info {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0f7fa 0%, #b2ebf2 100%);
        border: none;
        padding: 30px;
        margin-top: 30px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        text-align: center;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        animation: fadeInUp 1s ease 1s backwards;
      }

      .delivery-info p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin: 0;
        color: #004d40;
      }

      .delivery-info strong {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .btn-group {
        display: flex;
        gap: 15px;
        margin-top: 30px;
      }

      .btn {
        padding: 15px 40px;
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 30px;
        transition: var(--transition);
        text-decoration: none;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .btn-primary {
        background: var(--gradient-dark);
        color: white;
      }

      .btn-outline {
        background: transparent;
        border: 2px solid var(--text);
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .timeline {
        position: relative;
        padding: 20px 0;
        margin: 40px 0;
      }

      .timeline::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        width: 2px;
        height: 100%;
        background: var(--border);
      }

      .timeline-item {
        position: relative;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        width: 50%;
        padding-right: 40px;
      }

      .timeline-item:nth-child(even) {
        margin-left: auto;
        padding-right: 0;
        padding-left: 40px;
      }

      .timeline-content {
        background: white;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        position: relative;
      }

      .timeline-content::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 20px;
        right: -10px;
        width: 20px;
        height: 20px;
        background: var(--accent);
        border-radius: 50%;
      }

      .timeline-item:nth-child(even) .timeline-content::before {
        right: auto;
        left: -10px;
      }

      .timeline-date {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--text-light);
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .timeline-title {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
      }

      @keyframes fadeInUp {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(20px);
        }
        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: translateY(0);
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .detail-container {
          margin: 40px auto;
          padding: 0 15px;
        }

        .detail-header {
          padding: 30px 20px;
        }

        .detail-body {
          padding: 25px;
        }

        .info-block {
          padding: 20px;
        }

        .info-block p {
          font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .table td {
          padding: 15px 10px;
          font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .delivery-info {
          padding: 20px;
        }

        .delivery-info p {
          font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .btn-group {
          flex-direction: column;
        }

        .btn {
          width: 100%;
        }

        .timeline::before {
          left: 20px;
        }

        .timeline-item {
          width: 100%;
          padding-left: 50px;
          padding-right: 0;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(even) {
          padding-left: 50px;
        }

        .timeline-content::before {
          left: -10px;
          right: auto;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- Include header.ejs -->
    <%- include('../../partials/header.ejs') %>

    <div class="detail-container">
      <div class="detail-card">
        <div class="detail-header">
          <div class="order-status">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle mr-2"></i>Đơn hàng đã xác nhận
          </div>
          <div class="order-id">Mã đơn hàng: #<%= order._id.toString().slice(-6).toUpperCase() %></div>
          <div class="order-date">Đặt hàng lúc: <%= orderDate %></div>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-body">
          <div class="info-section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Thông tin khách hàng</h2>
            <div class="info-block">
              <p>
                <strong>Khách hàng:</strong> <%= order.user_info.fullName %><br />
                <strong>Email:</strong> <%= order.user_info.email %><br />
                <strong>Số điện thoại:</strong> <%= order.user_info.phone %><br />
                <strong>Địa chỉ:</strong> <%= order.user_info.address %>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="info-section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Chi tiết đơn hàng</h2>
            <div class="table-responsive">
              <table class="table">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Sản phẩm</th>
                    <th>Số lượng</th>
                    <th>Giá (VNĐ)</th>
                    <th>Thành tiền (VNĐ)</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <% order.product_info.forEach(product => { %>
                  <tr>
                    <td data-label="Sản phẩm"><%= product.title %></td>
                    <td data-label="Số lượng"><%= product.quantity %></td>
                    <td data-label="Giá"><%= product.price.toLocaleString() %></td>
                    <td data-label="Thành tiền"><%= product.total.toLocaleString() %></td>
                  </tr>
                  <% }) %>
                </tbody>
                <tfoot>
                  <tr class="total-row">
                    <td colspan="3">Tổng cộng</td>
                    <td><%= order.totalPriceAll.toLocaleString() %> VNĐ</td>
                  </tr>
                </tfoot>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="info-section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Trạng thái đơn hàng</h2>
            <div class="timeline">
              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <div class="timeline-date"><%= orderDate %></div>
                  <div class="timeline-title">Đơn hàng đã được đặt</div>
                  <p>Chúng tôi đã nhận được đơn hàng của bạn</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <div class="timeline-date"><%= orderDate %></div>
                  <div class="timeline-title">Đơn hàng đã được xác nhận</div>
                  <p>Đơn hàng của bạn đã được xác nhận và đang được xử lý</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <div class="timeline-date"><%= deliveryDate %></div>
                  <div class="timeline-title">Dự kiến giao hàng</div>
                  <p>Đơn hàng của bạn sẽ được giao trong ngày này</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="delivery-info">
            <p>
              📦 <strong>Đơn hàng của bạn đang được xử lý!</strong><br />
              Dự kiến giao hàng: <strong><%= deliveryDate %></strong><br />
              Vui lòng kiểm tra email hoặc liên hệ với chúng tôi nếu bạn cần hỗ trợ thêm.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="btn-group">
            <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Tiếp tục mua sắm</a>
            <a href="javascript:window.print()" class="btn btn-outline">In đơn hàng</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Include footer.ejs -->
    <%- include('../../partials/footer.ejs') %>

    <!-- Scripts -->
    <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.3.1.slim.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/popper.js@1.14.7/dist/umd/popper.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@4.3.1/dist/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
  </body>
</html> 